iv></div></section><section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-slate-50 to-eurogold-50/20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-eurogold-100 text-eurogold-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full mb-4"><i class="fas fa-book-open"></i>Overview</span><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">PED Certification</h2><div class="w-20 h-1 mx-auto rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-eurogold-400 to-euro-600 mb-6"></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">The Pressure Equipment Directive (PED) 2014/68/EU governs the design, manufacture, and conformity assessment of pressure equipment and assemblies placed on the European market. It entered into force on 20 July 2016, fully replacing the earlier Directive 97/23/EC.</p></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8 items-start"><div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-200/70 shadow-xl shadow-eurogold-500/10 bg-white self-start"><table class="w-full text-[13px]"><thead class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#030a16] via-euro-800 to-[#0a2463]"><tr><th class="text-left px-3 py-2.5 font-bold text-eurogold-300 border-b border-white/10 uppercase tracking-wider">Aspect</th><th class="text-left px-3 py-2.5 font-bold text-eurogold-300 border-b border-white/10 uppercase tracking-wider">Previous</th><th class="text-left px-3 py-2.5 font-bold text-eurogold-300 border-b border-white/10 uppercase tracking-wider">Current</th></tr></thead><tbody class="bg-white"><tr class="odd:bg-slate-50/60"><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 font-semibold text-slate-800">Reference</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-600">97/23/EC</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 font-bold text-euro-700">2014/68/EU</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-slate-50/60"><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 font-semibold text-slate-800">In Force Since</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-600">30 May 2002</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 font-bold text-euro-700">20 July 2016</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-slate-50/60"><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 font-semibold text-slate-800">Status</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-400">Superseded</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 font-bold text-emerald-600">Currently Applicable</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-slate-50/60"><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 font-semibold text-slate-800">Simple Vessels</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-600">2009/105/EC</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-700">2014/29/EU</td></tr><tr class="odd:bg-slate-50/60"><td class="px-3 py-2.5 font-semibold text-slate-800">Transportable</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 text-slate-600">99/36/EC</td><td class="px-3 py-2.5 text-slate-700">2010/35/EU</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 to-transparent z-10"></div><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367757/eurocert/real.jpeg.jpg" alt="Pressure equipment safety and EU PED compliance overview" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"/><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 z-20"><p class="text-white font-semibold">Ensuring Safety &amp; Free Trade</p><p class="text-white/70 text-sm">Across all EU member states</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16] via-[#0a1628] to-[#030a16] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-